        "In this second module of Day 50, we construct our ProductionVbaBatchEngine in pure Python. We simulate the high-speed processing of 100,000 ledger records, prove the execution of exactly two COM boundary calls, simulate runtime exception handling with guaranteed state restoration, and verify complete SOX audit logging.",
